added_cards.content:
{% set operation = states('sensor.siemens_tvatt_tork_driftsstatus').split('.')[-1] %}
{% set progress = states('sensor.siemens_tvatt_tork_aktuell_programstatus') %}
{% set finish = as_timestamp(states('sensor.siemens_tvatt_tork_aterstaende_programtid'), none) %}
<ha-icon icon="mdi:washing-machine"></ha-icon> **Tvätt/tork · {{ {'Run': 'Kör program', 'Pause': 'Pausad', 'ActionRequired': 'Åtgärd krävs'}.get(operation, 'Inväntar status') }}**

{% if is_number(progress) %}**{{ progress | float | round(0) | int }} %** klart{% else %}Förlopp saknas{% endif %} · {% if operation == 'Pause' %}Tid uppdateras när programmet fortsätter{% elif operation == 'ActionRequired' %}Kontrollera maskinen{% elif finish is not none and finish > as_timestamp(now()) %}{% set minutes = ((finish - as_timestamp(now())) / 60) | round(0, 'ceil') | int %}Cirka {% if minutes >= 60 %}{{ minutes // 60 }} h {% endif %}{{ minutes % 60 }} min kvar{% else %}Inväntar tidsprognos{% endif %}

style.ha-markdown$:
ha-icon {
  color: #64b5c6;
  --mdc-icon-size: 24px;
  display: inline-block;
  margin-right: 6px;
  vertical-align: middle;
  animation: {{ 'printer-soft-pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite' if is_state('sensor.siemens_tvatt_tork_driftsstatus', 'BSH.Common.EnumType.OperationState.Run') else 'none' }};
}
@keyframes printer-soft-pulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3px rgba(100,181,198,0.45)); }
  50% { opacity: 0.5; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0px rgba(100,181,198,0)); }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  ha-icon { animation: none; }
}

